[{"client_msg_id":"b7dd3678-05ca-4b9b-80a8-98be375f811b","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"だめというかそうするしかないのでそうしてますね。。（すいません、 `import lambda` の件は単に雑談です）","ts":"1634871160.166700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U7TMPGWJ0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HaPS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7997e381-d600-4fa5-ae6f-0daf205b0dfe","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"サンプルとかでよく見る気がする","ts":"1634869921.164000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gsGY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68788576-bd5b-4da5-bb06-7f8855d3faf1","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"基本的にモジュール名、パッケージ名にアンスコいれるのは避けたいですが `lambda_function` とかじゃ駄目なんですかね？","ts":"1634869780.163700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AjH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01399e5c-9e5c-46b4-95a6-23ffcc6a4097","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"わかる。 `import lambda` できないというのは単にPython+AWS Lambdaで困っていることと言うだけでPythonの仕様上回避できないですね。","ts":"1634869200.160000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e8m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b180fe41-2fc9-446e-a250-c6304a10d6e1","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"予約語と被るモジュール・パッケージ名はいずれにせよ避けるべきだとは思います…","ts":"1634869101.157800","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1634869198.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U02GD5GRJ72"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"phc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb26b908-47ec-4d34-b11c-448862d083cf","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"```import lambda as lm```\nの代わりに\n```lm = __import__('lambda')```\nでいけるらしいです。\n\u003chttps://docs.python.org/ja/3/library/importlib.html|参考\u003e","ts":"1634865666.156600","edited":{"user":"U02GD5GRJ72","ts":"1634866011.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HLH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8244ce90-95f6-48dc-8ac0-680ef3cd8d56","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"他の場所で直接  `python lamdba.py` とかされているときにその依存関係を壊したくない時とかリンクを貼るといいかもしれません。\n多分 `import lambda` は言語の使用上できないのだと思います。","ts":"1634865246.155400","edited":{"user":"U02GD5GRJ72","ts":"1634865254.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HJLcH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d4edb92-7dc4-48c8-9bac-6749d66793b6","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"`import lambda` できないのが辛い","ts":"1634865093.152600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GWzUB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c86861a4-2049-4861-9350-f70623c030ce","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"なるほど。。シンボリックリンク張るならそもそも `lam.py` という名前で作っちゃいそうです。。","ts":"1634865060.151500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZLp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42e37f62-acb4-41c1-89f5-b80187513d20","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"求められてる回答か分かりませんが、 `ln -s lambda.py lam.py` のようにリンクを貼った上で、\n```import lam```\nのようにすると既存の依存関係を崩さずに済むと思います。","ts":"1634864926.150800","edited":{"user":"U02GD5GRJ72","ts":"1634865001.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ur7qV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa3f9d4a-54df-4428-a788-0e1b6bccb979","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"Python+AWS Lambdaでちょっと困ってるのが `lambda` がPythonで予約語？なので `lamdba.py` というファイルを作って `import` できないことですね。","ts":"1634864080.147900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"94T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff033c4c-45fd-4cad-a252-2085328b9b16","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u0026gt; しかし通常 1 つのプロジェクト内に複数のパッケージを含めて開発することはありません。\n多分このパターンなので難しんだろうなーという印象です。\n`function` の下に複数のディレクトリが切られて、それぞれが違うPythonプロジェクトっぽく振る舞っています。\nただし、pytestはその更に上の階層で全部のテストを管理したいという構造です。","ts":"1634863964.146800","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1634863982.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Byr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ecdd032-cbba-40a5-b211-189543e34dd6","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"蛇足かもしれませんが \u003chttps://rinatz.github.io/python-book/ch04-07-project-structures/\u003e\nここにあるように、 `__main__.py` を使うというのはどうでしょう？","ts":"1634862258.145000","attachments":[{"fallback":"4.7. プロジェクト構成 - ゼロから学ぶ Python","id":1,"title":"4.7. プロジェクト構成 - ゼロから学ぶ Python","title_link":"https://rinatz.github.io/python-book/ch04-07-project-structures/","text":"ゼロから学ぶ Python","blocks":null,"service_name":"rinatz.github.io","from_url":"https://rinatz.github.io/python-book/ch04-07-project-structures/","original_url":"https://rinatz.github.io/python-book/ch04-07-project-structures/"}],"edited":{"user":"U02GD5GRJ72","ts":"1634862284.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iwtCK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43a79fb4-e2f4-4f9a-8cfc-5ba0762c43c5","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"なるほど、みなさんありがとうございました!\nappというダミーディレクトリを挟めば上手く行きそうです!","ts":"1634838448.142500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":3,"users":["U78A6ESHM","U01D9BALEKU","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yNh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"079dcd52-5169-4684-bf95-8baa477c2454","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"AWSは `sample_function` の中でこうやって呼んでるということか。\n```$ python -m app.index\n0.0.1```","ts":"1634838257.142300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dhs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b216781-7035-4abf-95e1-8e5a2956132c","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"これか。\n\u0026gt; AWS Lambda loads your handler as a module import not as a top-level script","ts":"1634838181.142000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ok6A5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd3649da-b484-41e3-908a-fb1a30a66ff1","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"んー。gistの `app` というディレクトリを挟む方法、同じようにエラーになってる感じあるなぁ。。\nAWSにデプロイしないと上手く動くか分からん系か。。？\n```$ pytest\n============================= test session starts ==============================\nplatform linux -- Python 3.8.6, pytest-6.2.5, py-1.10.0, pluggy-1.0.0\nrootdir: /home/conao/dev/python/rel-import-lambda\ncollected 1 item                                                               \n\ntest/app/function/sample_function/test_main.py .                         [100%]\n\n============================== 1 passed in 0.01s ===============================\n(rel-import-lambda-NbGL2NV7-py3.8) conao-manjaro-helios:~/dev/python/rel-import-lambda conao\n\n$ cd app/function/sample_function/\n.  ..  app\n\n$ python app/index.py \nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"app/index.py\", line 1, in \u0026lt;module\u0026gt;\n    from . import util\nImportError: attempted relative import with no known parent package\n\n$ cd ../../../\n\n$ tree\n.\n├── app\n│   └── function\n│       └── sample_function\n│           └── app\n│               ├── index.py\n│               └── util.py\n├── poetry.lock\n├── pyproject.toml\n└── test\n    ├── app\n    │   ├── function\n    │   │   ├── __init__.py\n    │   │   └── sample_function\n    │   │       ├── __init__.py\n    │   │       └── test_main.py\n    │   └── __init__.py\n    └── __init__.py\n\n13 directories, 16 files```","ts":"1634838116.141800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tcp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67e5abed-d170-4e3f-a4f7-6de6afaee6fa","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"なるほどとりあえずAWS Lambdaがよくわからんことがよくわかった:yoshi:","ts":"1634838083.141400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G8B/o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b823185f-d97a-48eb-b855-4588ee81d301","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"他プロセスというか名前空間ですね。sample_funtionディレクトリにutilというファイルがありますが、foo_functionというディレクトリにutilと同名で別内容のソースが置かれることを想定する必要があります。","ts":"1634837709.140200","thread_ts":"1634837012.132000","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kR7f"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"32957592-f0b4-463f-a1f3-9e84fd13ee5f","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"app/functionには複数のLambdaが置かれるので、sys.pathを弄ると他のLambdaが動かなくなる可能性が。。","ts":"1634837012.132000","thread_ts":"1634837012.132000","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Ku"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"fc8896bf-875e-43be-a7d1-b67ac08250b3","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"もう別手段のが良さげだけど、`sys.path`をpythonスクリプト内弄っても他プロセスへの影響はないと思います","ts":"1634837620.139900","thread_ts":"1634837012.132000","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M1/1"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"32957592-f0b4-463f-a1f3-9e84fd13ee5f","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"app/functionには複数のLambdaが置かれるので、sys.pathを弄ると他のLambdaが動かなくなる可能性が。。","ts":"1634837012.132000","thread_ts":"1634837012.132000","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Ku"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"dbcd6466-4779-4fb7-9b64-488fe787e634","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"lambda の docker イメージ使えば色々実験できるはず","ts":"1634837518.139800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6k7Qp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bdc13b4a-d9c9-4d7a-9593-42f797c73df4","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"環境変数いじれるなら`PYTHONPATH`に見て欲しい場所を追加すればパッケージとして相対インポートできるはず","ts":"1634837435.139300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A8n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c514681-e1c9-4140-9b3c-a84196c80265","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/UnitedIncome/serverless-python-requirements\u003e\nserverless framework 使ってよければこれが楽だった","ts":"1634837389.138000","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"UnitedIncome/serverless-python-requirements","id":1,"title":"UnitedIncome/serverless-python-requirements","text":":zap::snake::package: Serverless plugin to bundle Python packages","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"906","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"JavaScript","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":2,"users":["U78A6ESHM","UDPT2BZ6E"]},{"name":"puro","count":1,"users":["U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D5Y1N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf8e6b5f-af59-4094-ad35-d6b7ccc7c476","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"わろた","ts":"1634837387.137900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nXm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89b9f019-5429-4ddb-b415-a7e6bf8645b6","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"AWSが管理してるので分かりません()\nとりあえずindex.pyを放り込むと動きます。","ts":"1634837363.137400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T80rw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e45ce803-916b-447e-a42d-4e804681b6e8","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"lambda内python環境はどう管理されているんだ…","ts":"1634837317.136900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dsro2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd932fcf-e152-4bf0-840a-aa69e95b5219","type":"message","user":"U0