"1634837139.133900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"38iJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"154917d0-4283-4d7e-87a2-611957496e8b","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"AWS Lambdaなので、poetry installできません。AWSができるのは `python index.py` だけです (省略してますが ~多分~ おおむねこんな感じと思ってます)","ts":"1634837103.133000","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1634837158.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bMzUy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32957592-f0b4-463f-a1f3-9e84fd13ee5f","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"app/functionには複数のLambdaが置かれるので、sys.pathを弄ると他のLambdaが動かなくなる可能性が。。","ts":"1634837012.132000","thread_ts":"1634837012.132000","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Ku"}]},{"client_msg_id":"318a3276-bd53-413c-8899-251a7a74d7e2","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"エントリーポイントが分離されてないのが困ってる原因かと思いました","ts":"1634837008.131800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Uo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"885626df-a212-4816-85d6-c6039f6321c0","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"パッケージ化して相対インポートで書く、\npytestはこれでOK、\npoetry installでこのモジュールへの検索パスが通るのでappからは`from \u003chttp://package.xxx|package.xxx\u003e import xxx`で読む、でどうですか","ts":"1634836982.131100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PCOm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2abeb77a-196c-48b6-8692-149e1060b232","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"pytest.ini でtestpaths 設定するで、行けないかな","ts":"1634836954.130300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s0nL7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ea46587-6923-45cb-8a1a-5047496b2eae","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あとチームの人に説明できないw 動くけど。。という状況です。","ts":"1634836926.129300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TS6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5078ea73-f9c2-4592-84c5-b08a0ab99ef2","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"```$ git diff\ndiff --git a/app/function/sample_function/index.py b/app/function/sample_function/index.py\nindex 98ea1fc..c040333 100644\n--- a/app/function/sample_function/index.py\n+++ b/app/function/sample_function/index.py\n@@ -1,4 +1,9 @@\n-from . import util\n+import importlib\n+\n+util = type(\"object\", (), {})\n+util = importlib.import_module((\".\" if __package__ else \"\") + \"util\", __package__)\n+\n+# from . import util\n # import util\n \n def main():```\nちなみに今のworkaroundはこれです。こう書くとトップレベルの `pytest` と、cdして `python index.py` したのが両方動きます。ただどうにも見栄えが。。","ts":"1634836880.128000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wEH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2356d0c-c9db-45f7-bb6c-1875dce00f31","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"あぁなるほど","ts":"1634836862.127300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RaUJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ccf17fc2-2349-4726-9ea9-ff77525eb386","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"だめですね。AWSにはsample_function以下しかデプロイされないので、app以下に配置されているのは知りようがありません。","ts":"1634836670.126100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bDmc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2605a616-b3a4-4fd5-82ea-65eda4045364","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":":cat-dogeza-mike:","ts":"1634836659.125900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"iinoyo","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gD+P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a285c924-a4d6-4e13-b5ad-0a5ddca2015b","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"煽られてるかとw","ts":"1634836632.125600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/u333"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7fc03a7-4921-4b8c-b2b9-79487461cea0","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"typo ひどいw","ts":"1634836618.125400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ert"}]},{"client_msg_id":"faa14b6f-9d96-4b1a-af2c-0ce19eb947c7","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"`from app.function.sample_function.util import version`\nではダメで~しゅ~すか？","ts":"1634836607.125100","edited":{"user":"U78A6ESHM","ts":"1634836633.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dhsih"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69d8c4a9-9a74-4b79-96c4-e568e2144804","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"まず、トップレベルで `poetry install` すると `pytest` が降ってきます。\n以降 `poetry shell` してる前提で話続けます。\n\n1) `pytest` すると簡単なテストが通ります。\nこの状態では `app/function/sample_function/index.py` には `from . import util` と書かなければエラーになります。\n\n2) `cd app/function/sample_function` してから、 `python index.py` で起動します。\n(これはAWSにデプロイされたLambdaを再現しています)\nこの状態ではエラーになり、 `app/function/sample_function/index.py` には `import util` と書かなければエラーになります。\n\nこれをどうすれば両立できるでしょう。。？というのが困っている事項になります。","ts":"1634836484.124100","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1634836557.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PXj=H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b3a313c-b8f7-43a9-b356-44eb36bffdcb","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/conao3/rel-import-lambda\u003e\n困ってる状況の最小構成できました。","ts":"1634836267.123800","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"conao3/rel-import-lambda","id":1,"title":"conao3/rel-import-lambda","fields":[{"title":"Language","value":"Python","short":true},{"title":"Last updated","value":"a few seconds ago","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b/Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"302fef2a-d5a8-430a-9a5c-307f207e8827","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"同じく何が問題かよくわかってないですけど(パッケージ作ればいいんじゃないのかなと思ってました)、解決してるのなら :yoshi:","ts":"1634835754.123300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yAmA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aec654ae-7acd-450e-816d-a6a351e4def6","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"最小構成作ってたら解決してるパターンかもしれない()","ts":"1634835699.122500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"aruaru","count":1,"users":["U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D9K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f812bbe-5242-4326-8080-c79e4a52bcf0","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"らむだわからん\nパッケージ化してたら`pytest`ってコマンド一発で全部テスト流してくれそうだけどあかんのですか","ts":"1634835659.122300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tvNw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a7b343a-c6d8-44d8-87ae-c3e74be77f17","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"localとかGHAでは使ったけど。","ts":"1634835586.120500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7owYk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed14715d-d78b-4b4b-99fe-196480a2e541","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"ごめんなさい。Lambda には使ったことないわ。","ts":"1634835549.120000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"gunnyari","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3cn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ee861c0-33a9-4dcd-98fc-a48ff409eb63","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"3しかかいてないけど、moduleやpackage, test とかのひながたを作るときにパクっているって、Lambdaの時だけ違うという話でしたか。","ts":"1634835512.119300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aDi9J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5338eb6f-3ef5-41f5-aee7-5ca16958a142","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"Python3でも大丈夫なんでしょうか。。？\n\u0026gt; 参考文献\n\u0026gt;     \u003chttp://docs.python.org/2/library/\u003e","ts":"1634835311.117400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w7R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a53b029e-05ce-45a5-b1d1-e89599a2a86a","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"python module と package に悩むので、 プロジェクトの構造化 — The Hitchhiker's Guide to Python\n\u003chttps://python-guideja.readthedocs.io/ja/latest/writing/structure.html#id12\u003e を毎回読んでる。","ts":"1634835244.117200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y=H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99e40e0e-5aa9-49fd-b573-c84c55ef79b9","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ローカルでテストするときと、実際にLambdaにデプロイしてAWSが実行する基準となるパスが違うという問題です。\nちょっと今サンプル作ってます。","ts":"1634835210.116700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yM8i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"466c5523-55ad-42eb-add8-b804822b8160","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"lamda未履修なので何に困っているかよくわからない…\n有識者求む","ts":"1634835136.116100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sRB8O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"765b0faa-986e-4ebf-8b59-c680523a7cc9","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"Lambda。。(カスタムランタイムでbashから起動するとか？)","ts":"1634835025.115000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"36NGC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ffae7aca-a058-4667-ba82-70f247eeaeeb","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"パッケージ化して`pip install -e .`してそれを使用するスクリプトは別で書くのがいいんじゃないですかね","ts":"1634834989.114800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mox=7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed3f7d8f-61d6-4578-bb7d-5b0bf1e1aeec","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"へー。なるほど。__name__が省略されているというのは新しい捉えでした。","ts":"1634834936.113400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yS1cA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9bbcf68f-0055-410c-b3ec-a8ca4333b211","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"わかる。今その方法です。ただ、pytestの共存で今めっちゃ悩んでます。","ts":"1634834903.112700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o9o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa6a171b-1252-4b0a-bf49-2c3a5230cc78","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"`from .aaa import xxx`\nは\n`from __name__.aaa import xxx`\nの略なのでモジュールとして実行しないと読めない、という理解をしている（間違ってたら突っ込みください）","ts":"1634834899.112500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7al"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ae77484-0ab7-49dc-8afd-0bea24635dce","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"importlib を使って無理やり読む方法はあるっちゃある。","ts":"1634834863.111500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XlM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e44c5e91-bd4e-478d-9428-649347d962da","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"詰み。","ts":"1634834854.111000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sGlo2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e18ab3fa-71df-4843-be4d-3d60cd4f6c63","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"実行させたい環境がAWS Lambdaなので、実行コマンド弄れないんですよね。。","ts":"1634834848.110600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZBqP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7aa8bb7e-817b-4661-9c82-04338c0ad9e8","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"モジュール実行ならsys.pathいじらなくても上の階層見れませんか？","ts":"1634834808.109700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n+eos"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a108d811-d239-4b03-9805-9b88948cc96c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"なんとなくモジュールとして実行するのが正解な気がしてきてる","ts":"1634834806.109600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hNX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4328a56-2d2e-4cc7-9127-0eba0827946f","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"というかsys.pathに入れるのは上のディレクトリを見たい場合ですね。これは同じ階層 (ただし実行したPythonファイルと同階層) の話なのでまた別っぽい。","ts":"1634834765.108600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3xCv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d39a4bd6-a9c1-4edd-8fa8-0de2d0cd0eb0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Python3が出たの2008年なんだな、パッケージ管理のベストプラクティスらしきものが出てきたのは最近なので仕方ないか","ts":"1634834674.108300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"woaAD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"951ecfce-fd33-496a-9365-1528f58beb77","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"`print(__name__)`したらmオプションありなしで違いがでるはず","ts":"1634834623.107600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Tuc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1074fc60-bca4-47fe-8da1-4728cd97bab7","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"sys.pathに入れろとかはそういう話かと。","ts":"1634834567.106200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FRh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7b6a884-8845-4670-96be-8a25c0dcfc6f","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ん。むしろ含まれてるのでは？","ts":"1634834533.106000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qXNx2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bebb814a-cc95-4e81-868b-5e06f1752e7b","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"パッケージトップレベルがパッケージ検索パスに含まれてない","ts":"1634834490.105800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UM1=h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"437b438e-ddcd-409e-810e-cb2b3045dd5c","type":"m